   "body": "Open-source Higgsfield on ComfyUI, open weights only.\r\n\r\n- 117 image, video, VFX and audio apps (plus 2 model-free test apps and 1 draft), covering 95 of the 129 tools and apps Higgsfield shows\r\n- Each app is one folder: an app.json manifest + a ComfyUI workflow in API format. The web UI, model downloads, VRAM map and tests are generated from them\r\n- Built on the Comfy SDK and comfy-api-proxy (Comfy API v2); runs on Modal or on your own GPU (tools/local_backend.py)\r\n- A lab ran every app on a GPU: 48 runs, 710 of 733 cases ok\r\n- Demo video: https://youtu.be/N7mv2v3Txeo\r\n\r\nFreefield is an independent open-source project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Higgsfield.",
